\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--type\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">TYPE</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms work-detail__type\" data-work-categories=\"live\"><span>IMMERSIVE AUDIOVISUAL PERFORMANCE</span></p></div><div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--event\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">EVENT</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms work-detail__event\"><span class=\"work-detail__line\">C-LAB 聲音藝術節「新銳當代音樂聲響聯合展演」</span></p></div><div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--venue\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">VENUE</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms work-detail__venue\"><span class=\"work-detail__line\">台灣, 台北, 臺灣當代文化實驗場 C-LAB</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--role\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">ROLE</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms\"><span>LIVE ELECTRONICS</span> <span>SOUND DESIGN</span> <span>SPATIAL / MULTICHANNEL AUDIO</span></p></div><div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__metadata-row work-detail__metadata-row--style\"><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-label\">STYLE</p><p class=\"work-detail__metadata-value work-detail__terms\"><span>ELECTRONIC</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-detail__actions\" data-work-detail-actions hidden></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__main is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wp-block-group work-detail__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"work-detail__eyebrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".45\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".3\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".35\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".9\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".4\"/></g></svg><span>LIVE</span><i></i><span>2025</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">Boulder 石</h1><script type=\"application/json\" data-work-share-source>{\"url\":\"/works/boulder/\",\"title\":\"Boulder \\u77f3\",\"category\":\"LIVE\",\"year\":\"2025\",\"cover\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/boulder-cover.webp\",\"roles\":[\"\\u96fb\\u5b50\\u97f3\\u6a02\\u6f14\\u594f\"]}</script>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--description\" data-work-detail-section=\"ABOUT\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-description-27\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-description-27\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">ABOUT</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-detail__post-content work-detail__description\"><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading screen-reader-text\">Description</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">《Boulder》是一個關於勞動、人工/自然、有機/無機的音像演出並以遊戲引擎打造，他們遊蕩、推著石頭、徬徨不定，宛如現實中人類縮影，透過遊戲引擎、電腦音樂、沉浸聲技術匯集而成的「Boulder」，試圖解構與重構這些當代問題，為現代人提供一個重新思考自身存在的場域，引導觀眾在技術敘事與身體感知之間游移。</p>\n</div></div></section>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--watch\" data-work-detail-section=\"WATCH\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-watch-27\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-watch-27\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">WATCH</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-media work-media--watch\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-embed work-media-embed--youtube\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-youtube-27\"><h2 id=\"work-media-youtube-27\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Video</h2><div class=\"work-media-embed__frame work-media-embed__frame--youtube\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"work-youtube\" data-youtube-id=\"7SytxVh0VYo\" data-youtube-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7SytxVh0VYo\" data-youtube-title=\"Boulder 石 — YouTube video\" aria-label=\"Play video: Boulder 石\"><img class=\"work-youtube__poster\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7SytxVh0VYo/maxresdefault.jpg\" data-youtube-fallback=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7SytxVh0VYo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"><span class=\"work-youtube__play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span></button><noscript><a class=\"work-youtube__link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7SytxVh0VYo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Watch on YouTube: Boulder 石</a></noscript></div></section></div></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--credits\" data-work-detail-section=\"CREDITS\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-credits-27\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-credits-27\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">CREDITS</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><section class=\"work-detail__credits\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-credits-27\"><h2 id=\"work-detail-credits-27\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Credits</h2><dl id=\"work-credits-list-27\" class=\"work-credits\"><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>影像設計</dt><dd>XTRUX</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>聲音設計</dt><dd>曾竣偉、黃詠仁</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>電子音樂演奏</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>攝影</dt><dd>三月影像、陳彥齊</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>臺灣聲響實驗室</dt><dd>黃意芝、陳家輝、溫泓凱、鄭詠心、曾靖軒、謝賢德、沈芸芳</dd></div>\n</dl></section></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--gallery\" data-work-detail-section=\"GALLERY\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-gallery-27\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-gallery-27\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">GALLERY</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-media work-media--gallery\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-gallery\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-gallery-27\"><h2 id=\"work-media-gallery-27\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Gallery</h2><div class=\"work-media-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"work-media-gallery__item\" style=\"--work-gallery-ratio: 0.8000\"><a class=\"work-media-gallery__link\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9.webp\" data-work-gallery-item data-work-gallery-index=\"0\" data-work-gallery-count=\"13\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Open image 1 of 13: Boulder 石 — SnapInsta.to_558779785_826333550049130_2186448081618670124_n.jpg\"><img width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-819x1024.webp\" class=\"work-media-gallery__image\" alt=\"Boulder 石 — SnapInsta.to_558779785_826333550049130_2186448081618670124_n.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1599px) 45vw, 720px\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-819x1024.webp 819w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-240x300.webp 240w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9-768x960.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1PKRieBAy63MuiXjqaUBz4yclZyjQ1qx9.webp 1080w\" /></a></figure><figure class=\"work-medi